(4 Non-Negotiable System Principles) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 540.00 Tm
(1. Never Autonomous Verdicts: The system never marks a customer or claim as) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 527.00 Tm
("fraudulent" autonomously. It flags risk indicators, shows supporting evidence,) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 514.00 Tm
(suggests alternative explanations, and leaves adjudications to licensed human) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 501.00 Tm
(investigators.) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 486.00 Tm
(2. Deterministic & Explainable: Risk scoring must be deterministic, mathematically) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 473.00 Tm
(reproducible, and traceable to specific document pages or database records.) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 458.00 Tm
(3. Privacy-by-Design: Personally Identifiable Information \(PII\) such as Aadhaar,) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 445.00 Tm
(phone numbers, and bank details must be sanitized before any data is dispatched to) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 432.00 Tm
(external AI models.) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 417.00 Tm
(4. Customer Transparency vs. Internal Confidentiality: Customers see milestone) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 404.00 Tm
(timelines, document checklists, and clarification requests. Internal fraud) Tj
ET
BT
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
/F1 9.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 45 391.00 Tm
(thresholds, investigator notes, and entity syndicate graphs are strictly segregated.) Tj
